Third-party components
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Ripcord depends on third-party packages resolved at build time (NuGet) and on
Microsoft platform components (the Windows App SDK, Media Foundation, Direct3D
12, WASAPI, GameInput). Those components are governed by their own licences;
none of their source is vendored into this repository.
